    'Cliffcrest sits on top of the Scarborough Bluffs with 1940s and 1950s bungalows that are steadily being replaced or reworked into homes that finally take advantage of the lake views, deep lots, and quiet cottage-country feel that draw people here in the first place. Ravine lots, TRCA setbacks, and slope stability considerations make the work more technical than a typical Toronto build.',
